meta {
  name: list movements
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}inventory/movements/?component=1
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  component: 1
  ~performed_by: 3
  ~project: 1
  ~movement_type: TAKE
  ~location: A11
  ~date_from: 2026-09-01
  ~date_to: 2026-09-30
  ~p: 1
  ~page_size: 25
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  The movement ledger, newest first (FR-6.5). Movements are never edited or
  deleted; corrections are new movements. **Staff only see their own
  movements**; Admins and Managers see everything.

  Filters: `component`, `performed_by` (user id), `project`, `movement_type`
  (`ADD` | `TAKE` | `RETURN` | `TRANSFER` | `ADJUST`), `location` (a chamber
  code that is the source or destination), `date_from` / `date_to` (YYYY-MM-DD,
  inclusive).

  ## API example response
  {
